# Content markdown

All site copy lives under `content/`. Frontmatter is `key: value` (one line per key). Body is markdown where applicable.

## `content/home.md`

Controls homepage sections and preview counts:

```yaml
---
name: Shubh Gupta
headline: Hi. I make things.
bio: ...
projectsLabel: What I'm working on
writingPreviewCount: 4
historyPreviewCount: 10
galleryUrl: /gallery
historyUrl: /history
peopleLabel: Gratitude
peopleUrl: /people
---
```

## `content/projects/*.md`

Required: `title`, `description`, `href`. Optional: `role`, `year`, `tip`, `order` (lower = first).

## `content/blog/*.mdx`

Required: `title`, `description`, `date` (ISO `YYYY-MM-DD`). Body is MDX via `MdxArticle`.

## `content/daily/*.mdx`

Required: `date` (ISO `YYYY-MM-DD`). Optional: `title`, `description`. Filename is the slug (`YYYY-MM-DD.mdx`). Section copy is `content/daily.md`.

## `content/gallery.md`

Frontmatter: `url`, `cloudinaryBase`, `intro`. Body lines:

```
id | cloudinary-filename.jpg | tile title | /p/0 | feature
```

Layout suffix: `feature` | `tall` | `wide` | omit for square.

## `content/timeline.md`

Frontmatter: `title`, `description`. Body:

```
- **2026-08-18** — Ships [wolfpdf](https://github.com/...), description
```

## `content/people/*.mdx`

Required: `name`. Optional: `slug`, `href`, `order`. Body is MDX via `people.ts` → `GratitudeView` / `MdxArticle`. Public section name is Gratitude; URLs are `/people/{slug}`.

## `content/pages/*.mdx`

Frontmatter: `title`, `description`, `heading`. Body is MDX via `pages.ts` → `MdxArticle`. Privacy, about, and contact are included in `src/app/sitemap.ts` through `getPages()`.

## After adding content

New blog slugs auto-SSG via `generateStaticParams`. New routes need `src/app/` page + `src/app/sitemap.ts` entry.
